REM draw green blot radius 100, then pause
COLOUR(GREEN)
BLOT(100)
PAUSE(1000)
REM draw red line length 450 upwards, then pause
COLOUR(RED)
FORWARD(450)
PAUSE(1000)
REM red circle, right 90 degrees, thickness 9
CIRCLE(20)
RIGHT(90)
THICKNESS(9)
REM colour blue, pause, draw horizontal line 450
COLOUR(BLUE)
PAUSE(1000)
FORWARD(450)
REM cyan, pause, circle, diagonal line to centre
COLOUR(CYAN)
PAUSE(1000)
CIRCLE(20)
RIGHT(135)
FORWARD(635)
END
